interface.longDescription:
GUARD GRC is an AI governance and compliance platform. This plugin lets you manage your organisation's AI governance in GUARD from ChatGPT, under your own GUARD login with two-factor sign-in.

Ask in plain words and ChatGPT works in GUARD for you:
- keep your AI system inventory current and have each system's risk classified under the regulations that apply;
- run a guided assessment of your company or of one AI system, then read its report and the gaps it found;
- generate a policy from the gaps you choose, and track its implementation plan action by action;
- prepare a DPIA, FRIA, privacy notice, AI transparency statement or DIFC Regulation 10 statement;
- build a regulator response pack and read your AI register as data;
- see what is waiting for your approval, request a sign-off, and prepare an approval you then confirm in GUARD;
- search the regulations GUARD holds and check a regulation's exclusions for your kind of business;
- see the regulatory changes GUARD has published and why they matter to you.

Everything ChatGPT does is stored in GUARD exactly as if you had used the GUARD app, checked against your role, and recorded as done through ChatGPT. Approvals and rejections are confirmed by you on a GUARD page with a fresh code from your authenticator app; deleting records and changing your team stay in the GUARD app.

Requires a GUARD account with two-factor sign-in. Answers are ChatGPT's reading of GUARD's content; they are not legal advice.
